      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 157,
        "y": 1409
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "The ball: position and velocity are State. Each frame it moves by velocity × the frame time (clamped so a stall can't tunnel it through a brick). It bounces off the side and top walls and off a broken brick (Switch picks the case); off the paddle, where it lands steers it. While it sits on the paddle it follows it, and a launch sends it up and to the right. In the demo the paddle follows the ball with a little wobble.",
